<title>UK: Sweden sets NZ$150 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets NZ$150 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDEN</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$150 MLN    COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    30.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.085   PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
